        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents I08-P7540-605 4 House Number Address Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFinally, an easy to read address marker plate assembly for your office or house. The 3-3/4\" high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color. This Polished Brass Four Number Address Plate Assembly is perfect for traditionally styled American homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <b>Four (4) Numbers</b>. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/three-number-polished-brass-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7530-605\"><b>3 Number Address Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/five-number-address-plate-brass-accents-i08-p7550-605\"><b>5 Number Address Plate</b></a>. \r\n<br>\r\nSee all the <a href=\"/collections/numbers-and-letters\"><b>Brass Accents Address Number Plates</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/house-address-plate-example.jpg?v=1704442267\" width=\"430\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents 4 House Number Address Plate Example\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents I08-P7540-605 4 House Number Address Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Number Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with 4 numbers, frame, back plate and mounting screws for easy installation. Assembled and Finished in the USA. Usually ships in one week.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBelow select your 4 address numbers in the order required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Polished Brass Four Number Address Plate Assembly, Brass Accents I08-P7540-605",
                "description": "Brass Accents I08-P7540-605 Polished Brass House Numbers. For use with Four (4) Numbers. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. Finally a easy to read address marker plate assembly for your office or house. The 3-3/4 inch high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color.",
